IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hia-medicare`

-- Health Insurance Act 1973, ss 3, 6, 6A, 7, 8, 9, 10, 10AC-10ADA, 14, 17, 19, 20, 20A, 128C, with the Health Insurance
-- Regulations 2018 ss 28, 65B, 65C, 90 -- worked cases from the patient's seat.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case or Services Australia practice.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_health-insurance-act-1973_baseline.py). Expected
-- results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts are from the Western Australian cradle-to-grave lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*) where they exist;
-- the event id is in the fixture's name. Every Schedule fee and fee charged is HYPOTHETICAL: the Medicare Benefits Schedule is
-- not deposited. `printed` is the set of safety-net amounts AS PRINTED in Compilation No. 136, which s 10A indexes, so no
-- safety-net result here is the amount for any real year. Persons not named in a life are invented for the case.

§ `Fixtures`

`printed` MEANS `the safety-net amounts as printed in Compilation No. 136`

